#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/hvm_networks.rst:156
msgid "**Router** — Select the OVS Bridge Domain virtual switch"
msgstr "**Router** — Wählen Sie den OVS Bridge Domain Virtual Switch aus"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/hvm_networks.rst:157
#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/hvm_networks.rst:227
#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/hvm_networks.rst:250
